## 📊 IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS

### Workbench Integration
```javascript
static async checkWorkbenchTimesheetStatus(user) {
  try {
    const { getUserTimesheets } = require('../workbench/api/timesheets');
    const timesheets = await getUserTimesheets(user.workbench_user_id);

    if (!timesheets || timesheets.length === 0) return false;

    // Check most recent timesheet (current week)
    const currentWeek = timesheets[0];
    return currentWeek.Completed === true;
  } catch (error) {
    logger.error(`Workbench check failed for user ${user.user_id}:`, error);
    return false; // Assume incomplete on error (better to send reminder)
  }
}
```

### User Query
```javascript
static async getActiveUsersWithWorkbench() {
  return await prisma.users.findMany({
    where: {
      is_active: true,
      workbench_user_id: { not: null }
    },
    include: {
      users_contacts: {
        select: {
          first_name: true,
          email: true
        }
      }
    }
  });
}
```

### Date Calculations
```javascript
static getSundayNight(date) {
  const sunday = new Date(date);
  const dayOfWeek = sunday.getDay();
  const daysUntilSunday = dayOfWeek === 0 ? 0 : 7 - dayOfWeek;

  sunday.setDate(sunday.getDate() + daysUntilSunday);
  sunday.setHours(23, 59, 59, 999);

  return sunday;
}
```

