## 💡 SCALABILITY - Adding New Reminders

### Example: Monthly Leave Approval Reminder

**Add to registry:**
```javascript
'leave-approval-reminder': {
  handler: this.sendLeaveApprovalReminders,
  notificationType: 'notification',  // Just informational
  description: 'Remind managers of pending leave approvals'
}
```

**Implement handler:**
```javascript
static async sendLeaveApprovalReminders() {
  const managers = await this.getUsersWithRole(['project_manager', 'admin']);
  const pending = await this.getPendingLeaveRequests();

  const managersWithPending = managers.filter(m =>
    pending.some(req => req.approver_id === m.user_id)
  );

  for (const manager of managersWithPending) {
    await NotificationService.createNotification(
      'leave_approval',
      manager.user_id,
      'reminder',
      '📋 Pending Leave Approvals',
      'You have leave requests awaiting your approval.',
      { link: '/leave/approvals' },
      [manager.user_id]
    );
  }
}
```

**Add Heroku job:**
